ldren":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," for the purpose of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfighting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfighting"}," (meaning that it can engage in and be engaged in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfighting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfighting"},") and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Maneuvers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers","referenceId":"reference:d34674a1187e91cd"},". This Starship Modification does not change the ship's size modifier to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
